    "cf69a5a84f884184e626fa4c4fcf8af657f63178e9e10d12e50ca6aed266f572": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "8143699eb07a10025055be98d490e2c6e73c1b54f36c1251f2a5ed51a9e324c4",
      "contextFingerprint": "a635854eb3f2922baf0c8b6ad55e1cae95b6fe637de031b9b1b97eb97849c0b3",
      "sourceText": "| 用法 | 说明 | 示例 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| `auto` | 自动推导值类型（会丢失引用和 const） | `auto x = 42;` → int |\n| `const auto` | 推导为只读类型 | `const auto s = \"hello\";` |\n| `auto&` | 推导为引用（可修改原值） | `auto& x = vec[0];` |\n| `const auto&` | 推导为只读引用（不拷贝、不可修改） | `const auto& x = get_value();` |\n| `auto*` | 推导为指针 | `auto* p = &x;` |\n| `decltype(auto)` | 保留引用和 cv 限定的完美转发（C++14） | `decltype(auto) x = get_ref();` |",
      "translatedText": "| Usage | Description | Example |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| `auto` | Deduce value type automatically (loses references and const) | `auto x = 42;` → int |\n| `const auto` | Deduced as read\\-only type | `const auto s = \"hello\";` |\n| `auto&` | Deduced as reference (can modify the original value) | `auto& x = vec[0];` |\n| `const auto&` | Deduced as read\\-only reference (no copy, not modifiable) | `const auto& x = get_value();` |\n| `auto*` | Deduced as pointer | `auto* p = &x;` |\n| `decltype(auto)` | Perfect forwarding preserving references and cv qualifiers (C++14) | `decltype(auto) x = get_ref();` |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 205,
        "outputTokens": 94,
        "costUsd": 0.000175
      }
    },
